dren":[{"kind":"text","text":"The blue area of the following picture describes the triangle with $$$a=1,b=1$$$ with cost $$$=1\\cdot A$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/d994e0bd92c30ab68c29f0fd3f0f40d618daea6364308f8b65efbbfa726f2b88.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Erase a specific point: Tenzing will choose an integer $$$i$$$ that satisfies $$$1 \\leq i \\leq n$$$ and erase the point $$$i$$$. The cost of this operation is $$$c_i$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Tenzing find the minimum cost to erase all of the points."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$k$$$ and $$$A$$$ ($$$1\\leq n,k\\leq 2\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1\\leq A\\leq 10^4$$$) — the number of points, the coefficient describing the hypotenuse of the triangle and the coefficient describing the cost of drawing a triangle."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$n$$$ lines of the input the $$$i$$$-th line contains three integers $$$x_i,y_i,c_i$$$ ($$$0\\leq x_i,y_i,x_i+y_i \\lt k$$$, $$$1\\leq c_i\\leq 10^4$$$) — the coordinate of the $$$i$$$-th points and the cost of erasing it using the second operation. It is guaranteed that the coordinates are pairwise distinct."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer —the minimum cost needed to erase all of the points."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"t